sequenceDiagram
  participant F as founder(或 mirror 房的另一 slot bot)
  participant D as Discord
  participant A as 适配器 bun server.ts
  participant M as slot comm.db mailbox
  participant C as Lead 会话 claude
  participant P as qa-529-discord-roundtrip.mjs
  P->>P: 生成 nonce · 先跑通道活连接 probe(不活 exit 35)
  F->>D: 发 [529-rt nonce] 请回复带 ack(T0)
  P->>D: REST 只读轮询 找到 T0
  D->>A: gateway messageCreate
  A->>M: chat-ingest 写行(source_ref = chat:lead:msgId)
  M->>C: 通知会话 notified_at(T2) / delivered_at(T3)
  P->>M: 只读精确查询 ingestObservedAt · T2 notified_at · T3 delivered_at(Lead ACK)
  C->>D: Lead 在 envelope 指定的频道/thread 回帖 带 529-rt-ack(T4)
  P->>D: REST 只读 找到 T4
  P->>P: 写 discord-roundtrip-nonce.json · 所有 deadline = T0+超时 · exit 0 / 30–34
